(2728985, 379457, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Now there''s a title for ya.  ;^)  Cute image - it''s well focused and exposed fine for the most part.  Might want to consider some type of diffuser for your lighting setup as the glare on the peas is a little too harsh IMO.  Back to the title - don''t put so much weight on the title making the image for you.  If you were to look at this image without any title at all, what would be your opinion.  Is there a story?  What''s the story?  Just another way of looking at it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  Now there''s a title for ya.  ;^)  Cute image - it''s well focused and exposed fine for the most part.  Might want to consider some type of diffuser for your lighting setup as the glare on the peas is a little too harsh IMO.  Back to the title - don''t put so much weight on the title making the image for you.  If you were to look at this image without any title at all, what would be your opinion.  Is there a story?  What''s the story?  Just another way of looking at it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 10:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728989, 377322, 54731, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, Tim? I think center would have worked better though...</td>', 'Nice picture, Tim? I think center would have worked better though...', '2006-08-15 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728991, 380275, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but PlEAse make your images larger</td>', 'nice idea, but PlEAse make your images larger', '2006-08-15 10:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728995, 378166, 30637, '<td valign="top">These bluish-hued peas are enjoyed all across the Quon continent. Used in Recipes: Celerity Salad; Green Curry; Hedgehog Pie; Pea Soup; Soy Milk. Also whole green peas and green split peas are derived from spring sown field peas (pisum sativum) and are usually referred to as blue peas before they are processed. So I guess you meet the callenge! You get an 8 for making me look it up!</td>', 'These bluish-hued peas are enjoyed all across the Quon continent. Used in Recipes: Celerity Salad; Green Curry; Hedgehog Pie; Pea Soup; Soy Milk. Also whole green peas and green split peas are derived from spring sown field peas (pisum sativum) and are usually referred to as blue peas before they are processed. So I guess you meet the callenge! You get an 8 for making me look it up!', '2006-08-15 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728999, 380742, 30637, '<td valign="top">This looks like an ad from the 40s or a picture from a school book.</td>', 'This looks like an ad from the 40s or a picture from a school book.', '2006-08-15 10:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
