(2729029, 377870, 55414, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, especially the sepiatone with the green, the look og his face.  Would have also made a great shot for the Beatles Song Lyrics challange</td>', 'Love the shot, especially the sepiatone with the green, the look og his face.  Would have also made a great shot for the Beatles Song Lyrics challange', '2006-08-15 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729044, 377825, 60495, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favorite salads but I will not hold that against your image.  Good Job, my only comment would be that the right center low area seems to draw my eye first but when I look at it a little longer I find more interest in the onions on the left and they are almost out of the frame.</td>', 'Not one of my favorite salads but I will not hold that against your image.  Good Job, my only comment would be that the right center low area seems to draw my eye first but when I look at it a little longer I find more interest in the onions on the left and they are almost out of the frame.', '2006-08-15 10:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
