(2729109, 380679, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Took me a minute.  I was wondering what that lined streak was cutting across the image.  The title helped.  ;^)  I wonder if I''m alone in this line of thinking?  Perhaps a little more of the light housing should be visible?  JMO of course.  Other than that I like the placement of your items and specifically the peas.  Well exposed and nice sharp focusing.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  Took me a minute.  I was wondering what that lined streak was cutting across the image.  The title helped.  ;^)  I wonder if I''m alone in this line of thinking?  Perhaps a little more of the light housing should be visible?  JMO of course.  Other than that I like the placement of your items and specifically the peas.  Well exposed and nice sharp focusing.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
