(2729297, 379039, 45533, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few artistic photos in the challenge, that wasn''t relying on cleverness.<br/> <br/>I like this so much, the detail is amazing, and the colors are great.  The border really completes the image.<br/> <br/>I really thought that this would be a challenge where not one photo would get into my favorites, but I was wrong, and I really hope this places highly.  It''s my top pick, but I''m not sure it will get a ribbon, but hopefully at least a spot in the top 10.</td>', 'This is one of the few artistic photos in the challenge, that wasn''t relying on cleverness. I like this so much, the detail is amazing, and the colors are great.  The border really completes the image. I really thought that this would be a challenge where not one photo would get into my favorites, but I was wrong, and I really hope this places highly.  It''s my top pick, but I''m not sure it will get a ribbon, but hopefully at least a spot in the top 10.', '2006-08-15 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
