(2729302, 380005, 63104, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, nicely crisp and graphic, so strong is that portion of the shot (the bowl and peas / soup) that I would lose the peas at the top right that were ejected by the centripedal force ( :) ) I know what you were trying to do, but the image is plenty strong already. What would be nice though is a looser crop, giving the bowl more room to breath. Well done for this</td>', 'I love this shot, nicely crisp and graphic, so strong is that portion of the shot (the bowl and peas / soup) that I would lose the peas at the top right that were ejected by the centripedal force ( :) ) I know what you were trying to do, but the image is plenty strong already. What would be nice though is a looser crop, giving the bowl more room to breath. Well done for this', '2006-08-15 12:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729303, 380695, 45533, '<td valign="top">A very well done, very clever photo.  On normal circumstances, the green would have thrown off the earthy tones of this photo, but I''m not sure that''s true on a challenge like this.<br/> <br/>But the way the pea is so shiny and perfect, like a pearl would be, is great.  Well done, I hope to see this place high.<br/> <br/>This was such a weird challenge...</td>', 'A very well done, very clever photo.  On normal circumstances, the green would have thrown off the earthy tones of this photo, but I''m not sure that''s true on a challenge like this. But the way the pea is so shiny and perfect, like a pearl would be, is great.  Well done, I hope to see this place high. This was such a weird challenge...', '2006-08-15 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
