(2729548, 380595, 50578, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea  however I think the foil would look better if you had pressed it down a bit smoother.  also  maybe remove one of the 2 candles at the back or use a darker backdrop.  But Still   3 cheers for the original idea and being unique to the challenge..</td>', 'This is a nice idea  however I think the foil would look better if you had pressed it down a bit smoother.  also  maybe remove one of the 2 candles at the back or use a darker backdrop.  But Still   3 cheers for the original idea and being unique to the challenge..', '2006-08-15 13:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
