(2729571, 378857, 61679, '<td valign="top">It is easy to see that you took some time to plan your entry; unfortunately, your image has a couple of technical shortcomings that are going to hurt your score.  First, the peas are not sharply focused.  I''m not sure if this is from resizing the image or from camera shake.  Most members use USM after resizing as a standard practice.  Second, the background color seems a little off.  Im not sure if this is a color balance issue or if you intentionally choose a greenish color for the background.  Either way, a white background would have helped the green color of the peas look richer.</td>', 'It is easy to see that you took some time to plan your entry; unfortunately, your image has a couple of technical shortcomings that are going to hurt your score.  First, the peas are not sharply focused.  I''m not sure if this is from resizing the image or from camera shake.  Most members use USM after resizing as a standard practice.  Second, the background color seems a little off.  Im not sure if this is a color balance issue or if you intentionally choose a greenish color for the background.  Either way, a white background would have helped the green color of the peas look richer.', '2006-08-15 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
