(2729751, 380556, 61679, '<td valign="top">No peas in the picture.  I think your score will suffer for that even if your intent was to be a bit out of the box.  Overall the image is not too bad and I like her facial expression.  It could use a little fill light on the right to tone down the shadow by the nose and mouth.  You could have did a little burning to help brighten her teeth also.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-22 13:21:26.</i></td>', 'No peas in the picture.  I think your score will suffer for that even if your intent was to be a bit out of the box.  Overall the image is not too bad and I like her facial expression.  It could use a little fill light on the right to tone down the shadow by the nose and mouth.  You could have did a little burning to help brighten her teeth also.', '2006-08-15 15:22:43.000000', '2006-08-22 14:21:26.000000', 1),
(2729754, 380748, 47274, '<td valign="top">eww</td>', 'eww', '2006-08-15 15:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729760, 379592, 61552, '<td valign="top">But text as part of the photo? Looks like it''s acceptable!</td>', 'But text as part of the photo? Looks like it''s acceptable!', '2006-08-15 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729761, 380190, 61679, '<td valign="top">A cute idea but the image has a snapshot look to it that doesn''t score well at DPC.  Part of which is caused by the lack of sharp focus on the baby''s eyes.  It also would have helped if you had included the baby''s entire arm in the image, as it doesn''t really add to the picture in its present form.  I would also suggest that next time you look at what objects are in the background and see which angle would be best to shoot at to eliminate as many distractions as possible.</td>', 'A cute idea but the image has a snapshot look to it that doesn''t score well at DPC.  Part of which is caused by the lack of sharp focus on the baby''s eyes.  It also would have helped if you had included the baby''s entire arm in the image, as it doesn''t really add to the picture in its present form.  I would also suggest that next time you look at what objects are in the background and see which angle would be best to shoot at to eliminate as many distractions as possible.', '2006-08-15 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729764, 380605, 61552, '<td valign="top">You''re out in left field!  That''s where I hang out.</td>', 'You''re out in left field!  That''s where I hang out.', '2006-08-15 15:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729770, 380605, 60477, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept...it''s an 8..would have been a ten if the snow was more convincing...</td>', 'Excellent concept...it''s an 8..would have been a ten if the snow was more convincing...', '2006-08-15 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729773, 380294, 47274, '<td valign="top">love the border</td>', 'love the border', '2006-08-15 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729775, 377659, 4919, '<td valign="top">pic doesnt look sharp enough..</td>', 'pic doesnt look sharp enough..', '2006-08-15 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729776, 379332, 47274, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2006-08-15 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729778, 380162, 4919, '<td valign="top">this is funny...</td>', 'this is funny...', '2006-08-15 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729779, 380514, 60477, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t eat this for a million dollars...but I''m giving you a high 8!</td>', 'I wouldn''t eat this for a million dollars...but I''m giving you a high 8!', '2006-08-15 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729781, 378921, 47274, '<td valign="top">lmao</td>', 'lmao', '2006-08-15 15:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729782, 380395, 4919, '<td valign="top">I like this pic a lot.. very nice</td>', 'I like this pic a lot.. very nice', '2006-08-15 15:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729783, 379662, 4919, '<td valign="top">great color...</td>', 'great color...', '2006-08-15 15:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729785, 380672, 60477, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the symbol...I would have backed the camera up a fair amount.</td>', 'I''m not seeing the symbol...I would have backed the camera up a fair amount.', '2006-08-15 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729789, 377870, 60477, '<td valign="top">I toyed with this same idea...went in another direction...nice job! 7</td>', 'I toyed with this same idea...went in another direction...nice job! 7', '2006-08-15 15:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729790, 379873, 61552, '<td valign="top">The photo doesn''t have any unnecessary junk in the background.  It''s simple and to the point.  For that I rate you a 6.  But the originality, and especially for the humorous "outside the box" work, I''m upgrading to a 7.  I like it!</td>', 'The photo doesn''t have any unnecessary junk in the background.  It''s simple and to the point.  For that I rate you a 6.  But the originality, and especially for the humorous "outside the box" work, I''m upgrading to a 7.  I like it!', '2006-08-15 15:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729792, 379341, 60477, '<td valign="top">This would have been much better minus the hand. A solid 5 for effort!</td>', 'This would have been much better minus the hand. A solid 5 for effort!', '2006-08-15 15:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729794, 379607, 4919, '<td valign="top">haha.. i Like this.. very funny</td>', 'haha.. i Like this.. very funny', '2006-08-15 15:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729795, 380595, 61679, '<td valign="top">Definitely a unique entry for this challenge but I''m afraid it suffers from a couple of technical shortcomings.  First, I like how you used depth of focus to lead the viewer''s eyes towards the back of the image.  The trouble is that the multicolored background causes the viewer''s eyes to continue past the last sharply focused pea.  The multicolored background also reflects a bit off the reflective base that the peas are placed upon, which promotes a flat look to the image.  Most of these issues could have been prevented if you had used a dark solid covered background.</td>', 'Definitely a unique entry for this challenge but I''m afraid it suffers from a couple of technical shortcomings.  First, I like how you used depth of focus to lead the viewer''s eyes towards the back of the image.  The trouble is that the multicolored background causes the viewer''s eyes to continue past the last sharply focused pea.  The multicolored background also reflects a bit off the reflective base that the peas are placed upon, which promotes a flat look to the image.  Most of these issues could have been prevented if you had used a dark solid covered background.', '2006-08-15 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729799, 377529, 60477, '<td valign="top">Seems you couldn''t choose between fire and peas...kind of doesn''t work best for either.</td>', 'Seems you couldn''t choose between fire and peas...kind of doesn''t work best for either.', '2006-08-15 15:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729801, 380620, 60477, '<td valign="top">good question...</td>', 'good question...', '2006-08-15 15:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729803, 379943, 60477, '<td valign="top">I give tens every blue moon...have a 10 on me!</td>', 'I give tens every blue moon...have a 10 on me!', '2006-08-15 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729805, 378800, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think you have a creative idea for this challenge; however, there are a couple of things I think you could do to improve your score.  First, the two peas in the spot light are not in as sharp of focus as the peas in the foreground.  Your title tells the viewers to look there but the focus issue forces the viewer to look back to the peas in the foreground.  Second, your concept would have been stronger if the light on the peas was more like a spot light.  Again, your title raises a certain expectation that the image doesn''t meet.</td>', 'I think you have a creative idea for this challenge; however, there are a couple of things I think you could do to improve your score.  First, the two peas in the spot light are not in as sharp of focus as the peas in the foreground.  Your title tells the viewers to look there but the focus issue forces the viewer to look back to the peas in the foreground.  Second, your concept would have been stronger if the light on the peas was more like a spot light.  Again, your title raises a certain expectation that the image doesn''t meet.', '2006-08-15 15:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729808, 379906, 60477, '<td valign="top">You should have saved this for the Magic Challenge...nive job</td>', 'You should have saved this for the Magic Challenge...nive job', '2006-08-15 15:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729814, 377511, 60477, '<td valign="top">I hope non of that goo dripped into you Soundsticks. Might have boosted the green for better impact.</td>', 'I hope non of that goo dripped into you Soundsticks. Might have boosted the green for better impact.', '2006-08-15 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2729815, 380275, 60477, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch..but it works to some degree.</td>', 'It''s a stretch..but it works to some degree.', '2006-08-15 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729818, 380395, 61552, '<td valign="top">Close!  That symbol is on the hood of my car.  Very clear, in focus shot, and good contrast.  A piece of the plate holder on the left is cut off.  7</td>', 'Close!  That symbol is on the hood of my car.  Very clear, in focus shot, and good contrast.  A piece of the plate holder on the left is cut off.  7', '2006-08-15 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729821, 380662, 60477, '<td valign="top">The Magic Pea...might have saved this for the magic challenge</td>', 'The Magic Pea...might have saved this for the magic challenge', '2006-08-15 15:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729823, 380005, 60477, '<td valign="top">I''m imagining...and I might get sick...but nice job! 7</td>', 'I''m imagining...and I might get sick...but nice job! 7', '2006-08-15 15:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729828, 380556, 60477, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to understand why this is in the Peas! Challenge.</td>', 'I''m trying to understand why this is in the Peas! Challenge.', '2006-08-15 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729832, 378707, 61552, '<td valign="top">Touching concept artistically displayed.  9</td>', 'Touching concept artistically displayed.  9', '2006-08-15 15:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729835, 379662, 63104, '<td valign="top">a shot worthy of advertising the healthiest of organic peas :) nicely done</td>', 'a shot worthy of advertising the healthiest of organic peas :) nicely done', '2006-08-15 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729836, 380712, 30049, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract in a way...like the texture and details.  Only minor complaint is there is a little glare from lighting in some of the high points.  Overall, nicely done! The strong diagonals work very well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Almost abstract in a way...like the texture and details.  Only minor complaint is there is a little glare from lighting in some of the high points.  Overall, nicely done! The strong diagonals work very well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 15:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729837, 380493, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top picks for this challenge.  I love the simplicity of it and the near high-key feel to it.  Nice choice in composition, the way you decided to include the amount of bowl rim, etc...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of my top picks for this challenge.  I love the simplicity of it and the near high-key feel to it.  Nice choice in composition, the way you decided to include the amount of bowl rim, etc...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729842, 378921, 61552, '<td valign="top">It''s gonna get ^%$&amp;^$''ed off!  You''re out in left field!  I like it!</td>', 'It''s gonna get ^%$&^$''ed off!  You''re out in left field!  I like it!', '2006-08-15 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729844, 380137, 56167, '<td valign="top">slightly off focus but good idea</td>', 'slightly off focus but good idea', '2006-08-15 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729845, 378921, 30049, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh.  I''m sure you''re getting a boat load of comments on this one.  Normally I wouldn''t vote very high for an image that includes a toilet bowl, but you''ve done this quite discretely, if that''s possible.  ;^)  On a serious note, I like the lines and the way you''ve put this together as an image.  The strongest point in this is the lighting.  It appears that you''ve used natural light from a window and it''s right on the money, although you''ll probably have a couple of "too dark" comments...<br/> <br/>Clever, cute, and well done - all rolled up in one.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This made me laugh.  I''m sure you''re getting a boat load of comments on this one.  Normally I wouldn''t vote very high for an image that includes a toilet bowl, but you''ve done this quite discretely, if that''s possible.  ;^)  On a serious note, I like the lines and the way you''ve put this together as an image.  The strongest point in this is the lighting.  It appears that you''ve used natural light from a window and it''s right on the money, although you''ll probably have a couple of "too dark" comments... Clever, cute, and well done - all rolled up in one.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 16:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729847, 380294, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice and clear veins and peas in the pots, well done</td>', 'nice and clear veins and peas in the pots, well done', '2006-08-15 16:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729848, 380695, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and detail in this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and detail in this shot.  Well done.', '2006-08-15 16:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729850, 378720, 41521, '<td valign="top">Peas?</td>', 'Peas?', '2006-08-15 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729851, 380497, 56167, '<td valign="top">love the photo of the cat, takes away your attention to the subject though, but she is still beuitful</td>', 'love the photo of the cat, takes away your attention to the subject though, but she is still beuitful', '2006-08-15 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729853, 379734, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is quite clever.  ;^)  I like the aperture selection as the DOF works very well here.  Placement of your subjects is good and including an odd number helps.  Only downside for me is the first two pea pods aren''t as well focused as the one on the far right.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is quite clever.  ;^)  I like the aperture selection as the DOF works very well here.  Placement of your subjects is good and including an odd number helps.  Only downside for me is the first two pea pods aren''t as well focused as the one on the far right.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729859, 379662, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, simple...this has stock image written all over it.  I hope after the challenge you get it out there and make a few bucks on it!  ;^)  Seriously, I like the way you''ve laid this out, the lighting is perfect, and the image is well focused and sharp thruout.  Well done!</td>', 'Clean, crisp, simple...this has stock image written all over it.  I hope after the challenge you get it out there and make a few bucks on it!  ;^)  Seriously, I like the way you''ve laid this out, the lighting is perfect, and the image is well focused and sharp thruout.  Well done!', '2006-08-15 16:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729860, 379039, 41521, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, even lighting and good detail</td>', 'Nice macro, even lighting and good detail', '2006-08-15 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729862, 378037, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a rich, earthy feel to it.  Perfect for the subject.  It''s refreshing to see a well captured image of this simple subject in a manner that''s not all cutesy and clever (some of those are fine also I probably should add...).  I sincerely hope this does well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'This has a rich, earthy feel to it.  Perfect for the subject.  It''s refreshing to see a well captured image of this simple subject in a manner that''s not all cutesy and clever (some of those are fine also I probably should add...).  I sincerely hope this does well for you.  Good luck.', '2006-08-15 16:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729864, 379291, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice photo, pity about the shadows but a very good idea</td>', 'nice photo, pity about the shadows but a very good idea', '2006-08-15 16:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729871, 378048, 56167, '<td valign="top">could have been more in focus the haze over the front peas draws my eyes away form the pod. but that is only my opinion,</td>', 'could have been more in focus the haze over the front peas draws my eyes away form the pod. but that is only my opinion,', '2006-08-15 16:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729876, 380714, 56167, '<td valign="top">looks overexposed, to bright and not clear enough, but a great idea</td>', 'looks overexposed, to bright and not clear enough, but a great idea', '2006-08-15 16:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729888, 380748, 28054, '<td valign="top">I just knew someone would enter this kinda shot, ha ha!</td>', 'I just knew someone would enter this kinda shot, ha ha!', '2006-08-15 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729901, 380177, 56167, '<td valign="top">like the Idea of a hand full of peas, so perfect focus on the centre, well done</td>', 'like the Idea of a hand full of peas, so perfect focus on the centre, well done', '2006-08-15 16:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729904, 380687, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice and bright</td>', 'nice and bright', '2006-08-15 16:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729909, 380710, 56167, '<td valign="top">well focused and perfect lighting, like the idea</td>', 'well focused and perfect lighting, like the idea', '2006-08-15 16:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729917, 380712, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! This is hands-down my top pick now that I have voted all the images. It is luscious and complex and entirely appealing as an image in its own right, challenge notwithstanding.</td>', 'Outstanding! This is hands-down my top pick now that I have voted all the images. It is luscious and complex and entirely appealing as an image in its own right, challenge notwithstanding.', '2006-08-15 16:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729918, 378763, 3087, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation is a technique that I think is hugely overused so it''s refreshing to see an example where it''s used not for the sake of it but because it truly adds something to the image. I love the black and white for the man himself - it really brings out the wonderful texture of his skin and the expression on his face. The bright green for the pea pod helps it to stand out against his skin and ensures we can really see what it is. Even though it''s the only thing in colour the focal point is still on the model''s eyes which I think is testament to how strong the portrait of him is.</td>', 'Selective desaturation is a technique that I think is hugely overused so it''s refreshing to see an example where it''s used not for the sake of it but because it truly adds something to the image. I love the black and white for the man himself - it really brings out the wonderful texture of his skin and the expression on his face. The bright green for the pea pod helps it to stand out against his skin and ensures we can really see what it is. Even though it''s the only thing in colour the focal point is still on the model''s eyes which I think is testament to how strong the portrait of him is.', '2006-08-15 16:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729922, 378707, 56167, '<td valign="top">its good to see peas of all stages good coposition</td>', 'its good to see peas of all stages good coposition', '2006-08-15 16:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729923, 380695, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice, good effect and great idea.</td>', 'Nice, good effect and great idea.', '2006-08-15 16:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729924, 380729, 60495, '<td valign="top">I would hate to get them mad, they look pretty organized. Fun Image.</td>', 'I would hate to get them mad, they look pretty organized. Fun Image.', '2006-08-15 16:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729927, 379620, 60495, '<td valign="top">The addition of the leaves was a great idea. Nice image</td>', 'The addition of the leaves was a great idea. Nice image', '2006-08-15 16:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729930, 380736, 60495, '<td valign="top">Classic!</td>', 'Classic!', '2006-08-15 16:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729931, 379186, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! The eye contact/ expression is great. The lighting is perfect for his/ her skin but it creates too shiny an effect on the pods and the shadows within the pods are a little too harsh for my preferences too. That said, overall it''s a fun and charming picture.<br/> <br/>EDIT: Having now seen the unedited version, I would say that lighting was not too harsh but that the processing introduced too high a contrast within the peas for my tastes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-24 09:48:35.</i></td>', 'Sweet! The eye contact/ expression is great. The lighting is perfect for his/ her skin but it creates too shiny an effect on the pods and the shadows within the pods are a little too harsh for my preferences too. That said, overall it''s a fun and charming picture. EDIT: Having now seen the unedited version, I would say that lighting was not too harsh but that the processing introduced too high a contrast within the peas for my tastes.', '2006-08-15 16:31:43.000000', '2006-08-24 10:48:35.000000', 1),
(2729933, 380742, 60495, '<td valign="top">The image has a lot of character.</td>', 'The image has a lot of character.', '2006-08-15 16:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729934, 379734, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Love the way the light brings out the veins and colours. Love the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Sweet! Love the way the light brings out the veins and colours. Love the shallow DOF.', '2006-08-15 16:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729938, 380739, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, color and lighting could be improved.</td>', 'Nice idea, color and lighting could be improved.', '2006-08-15 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729939, 379766, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is such a fantastic idea... I really love the idea of peas as pearls strung on a string to be worn like precious jewels! The positioning of your curves of beaded peas is just right and makes a great composition - though I think the addition of a needle would be great too. The lighting feels a little harsh on the white background though perfect on the peas themselves. Great image!</td>', 'This is such a fantastic idea... I really love the idea of peas as pearls strung on a string to be worn like precious jewels! The positioning of your curves of beaded peas is just right and makes a great composition - though I think the addition of a needle would be great too. The lighting feels a little harsh on the white background though perfect on the peas themselves. Great image!', '2006-08-15 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729946, 380612, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast by selecting various items to include in your image that make it stand out.  Almost like a frame within a frame.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast by selecting various items to include in your image that make it stand out.  Almost like a frame within a frame.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729950, 380727, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea and love the use of a reflective surface. Foreground is too shadowy for my tastes and that break in the line at the far edge of the surface is distracting being as close as it is to the focal point.</td>', 'Great idea and love the use of a reflective surface. Foreground is too shadowy for my tastes and that break in the line at the far edge of the surface is distracting being as close as it is to the focal point.', '2006-08-15 16:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729953, 380137, 56658, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Having white and yellow lines on black paper would have been better. Some flames would have been cool too.</td>', 'Cute idea. Having white and yellow lines on black paper would have been better. Some flames would have been cool too.', '2006-08-15 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729954, 379608, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and really like the composition, the curved background, the textures and the colours. Seems very strongly oversharpened with really heavy halos around the edges of the darker pebbles and copper vessel.</td>', 'Lovely idea and really like the composition, the curved background, the textures and the colours. Seems very strongly oversharpened with really heavy halos around the edges of the darker pebbles and copper vessel.', '2006-08-15 16:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729955, 379336, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is cute...and clever!  ;^)  Interesting how the focal point, being inside the can on the peas, has caused the front edge of the can to be blurred yet text farther down is readable.  Doubt that was part of the consideration during setup, but it''s a nice side effect.  Smile and keep having fun!</td>', 'This is cute...and clever!  ;^)  Interesting how the focal point, being inside the can on the peas, has caused the front edge of the can to be blurred yet text farther down is readable.  Doubt that was part of the consideration during setup, but it''s a nice side effect.  Smile and keep having fun!', '2006-08-15 16:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729959, 380741, 60495, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, I would take some of the orange cast out and maybe level the plate some, the peas look like they are hanging there and should have already rolled off the plate...</td>', 'Clever idea, I would take some of the orange cast out and maybe level the plate some, the peas look like they are hanging there and should have already rolled off the plate...', '2006-08-15 16:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729960, 380743, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, bold, vivid colours... interesting. Not sure why the peas in the pod are such an insipid khaki green compared to the single pea outside the pod though.</td>', 'Simple, bold, vivid colours... interesting. Not sure why the peas in the pod are such an insipid khaki green compared to the single pea outside the pod though.', '2006-08-15 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729961, 380544, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and fun to look at.  Your subject certainly stands out against the black background.  Question of the day for you has probably already been asked...how did you get the special character to show up in the title?  I need to know the answer!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is interesting and fun to look at.  Your subject certainly stands out against the black background.  Question of the day for you has probably already been asked...how did you get the special character to show up in the title?  I need to know the answer!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-15 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729963, 378763, 56658, '<td valign="top">I personally like selective desat and I think it works well here. You did a nice job in getting contast in the black and white parts. Nice take on the challenge. My only concern is that while a nice photo the peas are not the subject and would be lost without the selective desat.</td>', 'I personally like selective desat and I think it works well here. You did a nice job in getting contast in the black and white parts. Nice take on the challenge. My only concern is that while a nice photo the peas are not the subject and would be lost without the selective desat.', '2006-08-15 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729965, 380300, 30049, '<td valign="top">Jury is still out on how the voters are going to react to those blueberries in there...  ;^)  I like the pop it gives this image and was a interesting choice to make.  Overall, well done.  Good luck!</td>', 'Jury is still out on how the voters are going to react to those blueberries in there...  ;^)  I like the pop it gives this image and was a interesting choice to make.  Overall, well done.  Good luck!', '2006-08-15 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729967, 378855, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Ignoring the processing for a second, the shot is priceless - Love the huge volume of peas being stuffed in to the hard man mouth there! Personally I''m not a huge fan of the grunge look and I''m not sure I like it''s application here - the green from the peas seems to be blurred all around the skin of the mouth and there are really heavy halos around the edges of the hat, sunglasses etc. The original photograph itself I like!</td>', 'ROFL! Ignoring the processing for a second, the shot is priceless - Love the huge volume of peas being stuffed in to the hard man mouth there! Personally I''m not a huge fan of the grunge look and I''m not sure I like it''s application here - the green from the peas seems to be blurred all around the skin of the mouth and there are really heavy halos around the edges of the hat, sunglasses etc. The original photograph itself I like!', '2006-08-15 16:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729969, 377322, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and I bet it was really weird to do! Personally I think open eyes would be more striking and provide a great focal point but I accept that the closed eyes gives a different feel to it.</td>', 'Clever idea and I bet it was really weird to do! Personally I think open eyes would be more striking and provide a great focal point but I accept that the closed eyes gives a different feel to it.', '2006-08-15 16:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729971, 378920, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea let down for me by lighting/ exposure.</td>', 'Sweet idea let down for me by lighting/ exposure.', '2006-08-15 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729973, 378166, 43565, '<td valign="top">This same look could probably be achieved without taking a photo.</td>', 'This same look could probably be achieved without taking a photo.', '2006-08-15 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729976, 380745, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... not sure I get the point of replacing peas with MnMs. Nevertheless I do like the picture - the background is beautifully black and the use of reflection works well.</td>', 'Hmmm... not sure I get the point of replacing peas with MnMs. Nevertheless I do like the picture - the background is beautifully black and the use of reflection works well.', '2006-08-15 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
