(2729979, 380035, 60495, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I think I would have liked it better if the image in the center was not B&amp;W and the peas were in better shape but I still find the idea interesting.</td>', 'Interesting, I think I would have liked it better if the image in the center was not B&W and the peas were in better shape but I still find the idea interesting.', '2006-08-15 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
