(2729988, 380714, 30049, '<td valign="top">This shot is lacking some in color saturation, contrast, and sharpness.  The actual composition isn''t as bad as the score I''m afraid you''re getting on this.  Keep at it.</td>', 'This shot is lacking some in color saturation, contrast, and sharpness.  The actual composition isn''t as bad as the score I''m afraid you''re getting on this.  Keep at it.', '2006-08-15 16:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
