(2730000, 380005, 56658, '<td valign="top">I like the pun of the title and the overall compisition very much. the colors are very nice. while peas are the subject without the title they would be unrecognizable so i will have to deduct a couple of points for that. since the challenge was advanced I would have cloned out the hotspots on the blue ring.</td>', 'I like the pun of the title and the overall compisition very much. the colors are very nice. while peas are the subject without the title they would be unrecognizable so i will have to deduct a couple of points for that. since the challenge was advanced I would have cloned out the hotspots on the blue ring.', '2006-08-15 16:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
