(2730018, 380741, 30049, '<td valign="top">Your white balance needs attention.  The plate should be white?  Some additional contrast would help.  Also having a hard time connecting your image to the title used.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Your white balance needs attention.  The plate should be white?  Some additional contrast would help.  Also having a hard time connecting your image to the title used.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2006-08-15 16:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
