(2730208, 380704, 56658, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea. i think i would like it more if the lighting was even and the peas were stopped in motion. while it may be hard to get lots of light in the pantry a reflector or some aluminum foil covered over a paper plate could help light the other side of the woody and help you get a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'not a bad idea. i think i would like it more if the lighting was even and the peas were stopped in motion. while it may be hard to get lots of light in the pantry a reflector or some aluminum foil covered over a paper plate could help light the other side of the woody and help you get a faster shutter speed.', '2006-08-15 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
