(2730584, 377362, 45475, '<td valign="top">The set up would have been much better had you straightened out the backdrop and perhaps used the same material under your props as well. Not sure about the colour overlay, it definitely washes out any good tonality that may otherwise have scored you extra points here.</td>', 'The set up would have been much better had you straightened out the backdrop and perhaps used the same material under your props as well. Not sure about the colour overlay, it definitely washes out any good tonality that may otherwise have scored you extra points here.', '2006-08-15 19:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730597, 380757, 45475, '<td valign="top">Strong colours, but maybe a little too harsh? The very slight upward perspective doesn''t really do much for me, but had you gotten a little further down and then pointed the lens up.... I think that would have rocked. I did notice the set up looked a little phallic too? Is it just me? ;-D</td>', 'Strong colours, but maybe a little too harsh? The very slight upward perspective doesn''t really do much for me, but had you gotten a little further down and then pointed the lens up.... I think that would have rocked. I did notice the set up looked a little phallic too? Is it just me? ;-D', '2006-08-15 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730605, 377825, 45475, '<td valign="top">The lighting is way too harsh I feel. But you have made me hungry, if that''s any consolation...? :)</td>', 'The lighting is way too harsh I feel. But you have made me hungry, if that''s any consolation...? :)', '2006-08-15 19:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730610, 379341, 45475, '<td valign="top">A little too happy with the sharpening tool? Cute concept though.</td>', 'A little too happy with the sharpening tool? Cute concept though.', '2006-08-15 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730617, 380583, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lighting lighting lighting.... flash is too intrusive. What you needed to do here is have a really steaming hot bowl of peas at the ready, use low diffused or window light (probably to the right), black background, plonk the butter on, step back and take a nice shot of the butter melting as the steam curls up into the air... <br/> <br/>Having said all that, I''m terrible for not having enough light in my own shots!</td>', 'Lighting lighting lighting.... flash is too intrusive. What you needed to do here is have a really steaming hot bowl of peas at the ready, use low diffused or window light (probably to the right), black background, plonk the butter on, step back and take a nice shot of the butter melting as the steam curls up into the air...  Having said all that, I''m terrible for not having enough light in my own shots!', '2006-08-15 19:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730623, 380714, 45475, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, overexposed and washed out I feel. Sorry :(</td>', 'Unfortunately, overexposed and washed out I feel. Sorry :(', '2006-08-15 19:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730627, 379912, 45475, '<td valign="top">Foooooo! The contrast! Not sure how I feel about this one, may have to circle for another approach later on...</td>', 'Foooooo! The contrast! Not sure how I feel about this one, may have to circle for another approach later on...', '2006-08-15 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
