(2732658, 379729, 61318, '<td valign="top">very creative, well lit, well composed.  unfortunately, I wouldn''t be at all surprised if many don''t make the connection to "peace", even though it''s more than obvious.  one nit, the blue background is much too texturized and it''s not really a complimentary shade of blue.  it does distract a bit.  something darker and flat would probably have worked better.  ehh, but what do I know...</td>', 'very creative, well lit, well composed.  unfortunately, I wouldn''t be at all surprised if many don''t make the connection to "peace", even though it''s more than obvious.  one nit, the blue background is much too texturized and it''s not really a complimentary shade of blue.  it does distract a bit.  something darker and flat would probably have worked better.  ehh, but what do I know...', '2006-08-16 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
