(2734446, 380693, 56658, '<td valign="top">intersting take going with the chick peas although I always called them garbonzo beans. I like the reds in it and the red chopsticks add a nice touch. great call over going with a fork or spoon. the foreground peas don''t seem very sharp. overall nice job.</td>', 'intersting take going with the chick peas although I always called them garbonzo beans. I like the reds in it and the red chopsticks add a nice touch. great call over going with a fork or spoon. the foreground peas don''t seem very sharp. overall nice job.', '2006-08-16 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734448, 379033, 56658, '<td valign="top">different. I like the idea and the execution seems pretty good. good job.</td>', 'different. I like the idea and the execution seems pretty good. good job.', '2006-08-16 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734453, 377511, 56658, '<td valign="top">not really sure about the title (i am not seeing the sound reference). nice colors in the peas. interesting composition overall. may have been nice to not have the blue reflected.</td>', 'not really sure about the title (i am not seeing the sound reference). nice colors in the peas. interesting composition overall. may have been nice to not have the blue reflected.', '2006-08-16 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734462, 380749, 56658, '<td valign="top">peas seem maybe oversharpened. nice capture on the water dropunder the spoon. might have been nicer with a spoon that was deeper so you could see more of it.</td>', 'peas seem maybe oversharpened. nice capture on the water dropunder the spoon. might have been nicer with a spoon that was deeper so you could see more of it.', '2006-08-16 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734465, 379861, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice colors.i really like the background color. the shallow DOF works well here and the focus seems nice and sharp. good job.</td>', 'nice colors.i really like the background color. the shallow DOF works well here and the focus seems nice and sharp. good job.', '2006-08-16 16:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734468, 380757, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice and vibrant. good idea to place them in such a contrasting color of corn. good job.</td>', 'nice and vibrant. good idea to place them in such a contrasting color of corn. good job.', '2006-08-16 16:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734472, 380748, 56658, '<td valign="top">boy i will be suprised if you aren''t getting killed in the voting. semi clever play on words. not a particualy appealing photo visually for me.</td>', 'boy i will be suprised if you aren''t getting killed in the voting. semi clever play on words. not a particualy appealing photo visually for me.', '2006-08-16 16:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734473, 379945, 61323, '<td valign="top">To me, this is  beautiful and elegant. The subject seems to be the curve and my eye follows the curve from left to right, then the amazing wood followed by our star, the peas. This is so thoughtfully done, you must have considered showing more wood -- but the strong burnt orange seems,on my screen, to vacilate between background and foreground. eight</td>', 'To me, this is  beautiful and elegant. The subject seems to be the curve and my eye follows the curve from left to right, then the amazing wood followed by our star, the peas. This is so thoughtfully done, you must have considered showing more wood -- but the strong burnt orange seems,on my screen, to vacilate between background and foreground. eight', '2006-08-16 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734475, 378472, 56658, '<td valign="top">I think you should have cropped the bottom to get rid of the bowl. I''m not sure that theblurred forground adds much. it may have looked better from a different angle.</td>', 'I think you should have cropped the bottom to get rid of the bowl. I''m not sure that theblurred forground adds much. it may have looked better from a different angle.', '2006-08-16 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734478, 379861, 27373, '<td valign="top">Simply a classic</td>', 'Simply a classic', '2006-08-16 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
