(2734483, 378707, 56658, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea at all. could have also been aragned like the evalution of a pea. the background color is very nice, and the border works for me here. Not sure how new you are but sometimes people vote down on large borders because they feel the photog is trying to hide something. great job overall.</td>', 'not a bad idea at all. could have also been aragned like the evalution of a pea. the background color is very nice, and the border works for me here. Not sure how new you are but sometimes people vote down on large borders because they feel the photog is trying to hide something. great job overall.', '2006-08-16 16:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
