(2736798, 379332, 20056, '<td valign="top">Are You crazy???? Magnific!</td>', 'Are You crazy???? Magnific!', '2006-08-17 14:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737060, 378954, 27373, '<td valign="top">It''s spelled PISA- oh wait- I get it.</td>', 'It''s spelled PISA- oh wait- I get it.', '2006-08-17 15:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737160, 378166, 62470, '<td valign="top">blue peas-blue stupid Pick a challenge I have seen this picture twice.</td>', 'blue peas-blue stupid Pick a challenge I have seen this picture twice.', '2006-08-17 16:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737185, 379592, 35229, '<td valign="top">Very funny :)</td>', 'Very funny :)', '2006-08-17 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737186, 379123, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute title, however - your image is not focused well and the color balance is off.  Could also use some contrast and levels adjustments.</td>', 'Cute title, however - your image is not focused well and the color balance is off.  Could also use some contrast and levels adjustments.', '2006-08-17 16:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737191, 379911, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and abstract.  It also looks like a photo of a chipped tile?  From the kitchen perhaps?</td>', 'This is interesting and abstract.  It also looks like a photo of a chipped tile?  From the kitchen perhaps?', '2006-08-17 16:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737197, 379332, 35229, '<td valign="top">This photo wins I think. Good luck.</td>', 'This photo wins I think. Good luck.', '2006-08-17 16:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737207, 377362, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice looking cans.  ;^)  Several things holding this image down; 1) tossed together backdrop is wrinkled and messy looking, 2) the image is flat and really needs some additional contrast added, 3) is the backdrop white?  if yes, you need to set the B/W points, and 4) lighting is off or a levels adj is needed - looks underexposed, yet there is light glare on the cans...<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in this and future challenges.</td>', 'Nice looking cans.  ;^)  Several things holding this image down; 1) tossed together backdrop is wrinkled and messy looking, 2) the image is flat and really needs some additional contrast added, 3) is the backdrop white?  if yes, you need to set the B/W points, and 4) lighting is off or a levels adj is needed - looks underexposed, yet there is light glare on the cans... Best of luck to you in this and future challenges.', '2006-08-17 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737209, 380666, 35229, '<td valign="top">Very good, but the crack is distracting.</td>', 'Very good, but the crack is distracting.', '2006-08-17 16:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737217, 380500, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever title, but don''t depend on the title alone to sell your image to the voters.  I''m thinking you''re going to get hammered for not having an actual ''pea'' in your entry.  The toddler''s face is well focused but the DOF is too shallow to pull the hands and ball into focus - which is important as the green ball is your primary subject.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever title, but don''t depend on the title alone to sell your image to the voters.  I''m thinking you''re going to get hammered for not having an actual ''pea'' in your entry.  The toddler''s face is well focused but the DOF is too shallow to pull the hands and ball into focus - which is important as the green ball is your primary subject.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-17 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737224, 379186, 56658, '<td valign="top">cute photo. the eyes are very nice.</td>', 'cute photo. the eyes are very nice.', '2006-08-17 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737225, 379592, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute...must be a popular saying as I''ve seen it a couple of times now.  ;^)  I''m thinking you''re selling the message more than the challenge subject (peas).  The peas are underexposed and in shadows.  The white of the note in the foreground is not white enough - needs some adustments (levels, histogram, curves, B/W points...most any of these should do it).  All of this is JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute...must be a popular saying as I''ve seen it a couple of times now.  ;^)  I''m thinking you''re selling the message more than the challenge subject (peas).  The peas are underexposed and in shadows.  The white of the note in the foreground is not white enough - needs some adustments (levels, histogram, curves, B/W points...most any of these should do it).  All of this is JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-17 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737229, 378854, 56658, '<td valign="top">niec idea. the sky doesn''t match very well to me.</td>', 'niec idea. the sky doesn''t match very well to me.', '2006-08-17 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737233, 379110, 56658, '<td valign="top">IMO it woyuld ahve worked better if the DOF was deep enough to include the front.</td>', 'IMO it woyuld ahve worked better if the DOF was deep enough to include the front.', '2006-08-17 16:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737237, 379581, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  Adjusting the color temp of your image would remove the bluish cast and make your whites a little whiter (unless you were using blue to symbolize cold?).  For greater impact it might have helped to fill the rest of the frame with peas also instead of leaving the top open.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever idea.  Adjusting the color temp of your image would remove the bluish cast and make your whites a little whiter (unless you were using blue to symbolize cold?).  For greater impact it might have helped to fill the rest of the frame with peas also instead of leaving the top open.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-17 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737238, 378577, 56658, '<td valign="top">seems way too bright at the top. might hae been nice is the peas were not frozen and the focus on them were a little sharper.</td>', 'seems way too bright at the top. might hae been nice is the peas were not frozen and the focus on them were a little sharper.', '2006-08-17 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737240, 379291, 30049, '<td valign="top">This could have worked if the image was in focus.  The background, is it supposed to be black?  Some levels adjustment or B/W points might help with that a little.  Keep at it...and good luck.</td>', 'This could have worked if the image was in focus.  The background, is it supposed to be black?  Some levels adjustment or B/W points might help with that a little.  Keep at it...and good luck.', '2006-08-17 16:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737243, 378991, 56658, '<td valign="top">seems a little noisy. also might have been nice to have the butter a little more melty although that could have been ahrd to show.</td>', 'seems a little noisy. also might have been nice to have the butter a little more melty although that could have been ahrd to show.', '2006-08-17 16:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737246, 377511, 30049, '<td valign="top">What is it?  For the life of me I can''t associate ''Sound'' with what the peas are sitting on top of.  I''m sure once I''m told it will fit into place, but for now I''m not getting it...sorry.  I like your choice of using a diagonal placement and the black background works fine.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What is it?  For the life of me I can''t associate ''Sound'' with what the peas are sitting on top of.  I''m sure once I''m told it will fit into place, but for now I''m not getting it...sorry.  I like your choice of using a diagonal placement and the black background works fine.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-17 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737248, 378048, 56658, '<td valign="top">the idea and composition seems nice but the extra reflections int he mirror are distracting. I think it was mentioned that a special mirror can avaoid that. I would also have like a deper DOF.</td>', 'the idea and composition seems nice but the extra reflections int he mirror are distracting. I think it was mentioned that a special mirror can avaoid that. I would also have like a deper DOF.', '2006-08-17 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737254, 380662, 56658, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea, maybe some betterlloking peas would have helped.</td>', 'not a bad idea, maybe some betterlloking peas would have helped.', '2006-08-17 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737271, 380298, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice composition. perhaps a bit too bright on the end of the pod but ooverall very nice.</td>', 'nice composition. perhaps a bit too bright on the end of the pod but ooverall very nice.', '2006-08-17 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737277, 380556, 56658, '<td valign="top">That looks like a can of corn to me. sorry but DNMC but I will give you a 3 for the person being a"PEABRAIN" :)</td>', 'That looks like a can of corn to me. sorry but DNMC but I will give you a 3 for the person being a"PEABRAIN" :)', '2006-08-17 16:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737286, 380705, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  ;^)  It''s a bit static however.  Nothing really saying ''Wow'' in the composition.  It''s just there, know what I mean?  Nothing personal.  Negative space can work, as can centered subjects, at times, but doesn''t seem to be adding anything to the impact of this shot.  Maybe in tighter, a little angle?  Could be a little sharper perhaps too?  Just throwing some ideas out there.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute idea.  ;^)  It''s a bit static however.  Nothing really saying ''Wow'' in the composition.  It''s just there, know what I mean?  Nothing personal.  Negative space can work, as can centered subjects, at times, but doesn''t seem to be adding anything to the impact of this shot.  Maybe in tighter, a little angle?  Could be a little sharper perhaps too?  Just throwing some ideas out there.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-17 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
