(2739585, 379873, 57882, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  I like the somewhat gritty look of the photo as well, it matches the subject.</td>', 'Hilarious!  I like the somewhat gritty look of the photo as well, it matches the subject.', '2006-08-18 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
