(2742030, 379729, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but you needed a bigger globe or map to pull it off IMO. At this scale, the peas are too big to form a neat symbol.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but you needed a bigger globe or map to pull it off IMO. At this scale, the peas are too big to form a neat symbol.', '2006-08-19 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742032, 379289, 53509, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the bird to emphasize the peas.</td>', 'I like the use of the bird to emphasize the peas.', '2006-08-19 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742034, 380499, 53509, '<td valign="top">I like the colours used. The picture doesn''t seem in focus appropriately.</td>', 'I like the colours used. The picture doesn''t seem in focus appropriately.', '2006-08-19 17:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742037, 379332, 53509, '<td valign="top">Good use of texture. Could be sharper.</td>', 'Good use of texture. Could be sharper.', '2006-08-19 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742040, 380695, 17203, '<td valign="top">Your photo is good, but your punmanship needs work. Seek help. ;-)</td>', 'Your photo is good, but your punmanship needs work. Seek help. ;-)', '2006-08-19 17:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742041, 378185, 53509, '<td valign="top">The colours of the peas seem a bit unappealing. Perhaps another variety would have helped.</td>', 'The colours of the peas seem a bit unappealing. Perhaps another variety would have helped.', '2006-08-19 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742042, 379674, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I wish you had cropped it horizontally down to the flowers themselves. The rest just adds clutter IMO.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I wish you had cropped it horizontally down to the flowers themselves. The rest just adds clutter IMO.', '2006-08-19 17:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742052, 380688, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hilarious concept and good lighting, but I''m not fond of the stark white background. I think a simple "home interior" background would have added   context to polish off the story. A baby''s hand in the foreground woud be better still. 8</td>', 'Hilarious concept and good lighting, but I''m not fond of the stark white background. I think a simple "home interior" background would have added   context to polish off the story. A baby''s hand in the foreground woud be better still. 8', '2006-08-19 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742053, 380556, 17203, '<td valign="top">But, but... it''s corn! :-(</td>', 'But, but... it''s corn! :-(', '2006-08-19 17:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742060, 380748, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ewwwww. The jar would have been a nice prop for "Pea Sample" if simply filled with peas, but the colored liquid (I won''t speculate on what it is) really kills the appeal IMO.</td>', 'Ewwwww. The jar would have been a nice prop for "Pea Sample" if simply filled with peas, but the colored liquid (I won''t speculate on what it is) really kills the appeal IMO.', '2006-08-19 17:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742061, 378878, 53509, '<td valign="top">I love the way you use the frozen peas for texture. I can''t help thinking that the white space detracts from the overall composition, and parts seem overexposed. Great work though.</td>', 'I love the way you use the frozen peas for texture. I can''t help thinking that the white space detracts from the overall composition, and parts seem overexposed. Great work though.', '2006-08-19 17:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742062, 380512, 53509, '<td valign="top">Visualloy interesting. Neat way of "freezing" peas.</td>', 'Visualloy interesting. Neat way of "freezing" peas.', '2006-08-19 17:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742064, 379662, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wonderful crisp detail and color, though I''m not fond of the yellow shadows and it''s cropped a little too close at the top. The same setup on white marble might add some elegance too. Still, very nicely done!</td>', 'Wonderful crisp detail and color, though I''m not fond of the yellow shadows and it''s cropped a little too close at the top. The same setup on white marble might add some elegance too. Still, very nicely done!', '2006-08-19 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742065, 377825, 53509, '<td valign="top">Many peas featured! The photo doesn''t seem to have any focus of interest.</td>', 'Many peas featured! The photo doesn''t seem to have any focus of interest.', '2006-08-19 17:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742066, 378037, 53509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour.</td>', 'Nice composition and colour.', '2006-08-19 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742068, 378991, 53509, '<td valign="top">Looks good enough to eat! And I hate peas!</td>', 'Looks good enough to eat! And I hate peas!', '2006-08-19 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742069, 380706, 53509, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Umm... your "table" is tilted.</td>', 'Cute idea. Umm... your "table" is tilted.', '2006-08-19 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742074, 378472, 53509, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of colours.</td>', 'Interesting mix of colours.', '2006-08-19 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742075, 380714, 53509, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Too bad it''s fuzzy and overexposed.</td>', 'Nice colours. Too bad it''s fuzzy and overexposed.', '2006-08-19 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742078, 380567, 53509, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, cute title. I wish I could see the rest off the glass.</td>', 'Ha ha, cute title. I wish I could see the rest off the glass.', '2006-08-19 17:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742079, 380287, 53509, '<td valign="top">Nice menace implied. The interesting bits don''t seem to fill enough of the frame and parts are overexposed / too harsh light.</td>', 'Nice menace implied. The interesting bits don''t seem to fill enough of the frame and parts are overexposed / too harsh light.', '2006-08-19 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742080, 378950, 17203, '<td valign="top">&lt;groan&gt;<br/> <br/>The straight-on view is your biggest enemy here IMO. A more interesting angle/composistion would help enormously.</td>', '<groan> The straight-on view is your biggest enemy here IMO. A more interesting angle/composistion would help enormously.', '2006-08-19 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742082, 380096, 53509, '<td valign="top">Nice title. There''s not too much in the photo to hold interest. I can''t see the texture of the pod, and the white just washes everything out.</td>', 'Nice title. There''s not too much in the photo to hold interest. I can''t see the texture of the pod, and the white just washes everything out.', '2006-08-19 17:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742083, 380688, 53509, '<td valign="top">I love the expression! Seems overexposed on the right side.</td>', 'I love the expression! Seems overexposed on the right side.', '2006-08-19 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742084, 379331, 53509, '<td valign="top">Nice way to draw interest.</td>', 'Nice way to draw interest.', '2006-08-19 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742086, 378166, 17203, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re intentionally using this blue to try for the brown. Good luck. :-/</td>', 'Looks like you''re intentionally using this blue to try for the brown. Good luck. :-/', '2006-08-19 17:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742088, 378707, 53509, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!</td>', 'Neat idea!', '2006-08-19 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742089, 380136, 53509, '<td valign="top">Good clarity. Why is there red on the fork? I think it''s distracting.</td>', 'Good clarity. Why is there red on the fork? I think it''s distracting.', '2006-08-19 17:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742097, 379662, 53509, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful way to bring out the greens. The light is well used.</td>', 'What a wonderful way to bring out the greens. The light is well used.', '2006-08-19 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742098, 379393, 53509, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour! I like your imaginative idea.</td>', 'Great use of colour! I like your imaginative idea.', '2006-08-19 17:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742150, 380556, 63360, '<td valign="top">Where are the peas?</td>', 'Where are the peas?', '2006-08-19 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742289, 380662, 63990, '<td valign="top">I don´t like the peas, they just look terrible.</td>', 'I don´t like the peas, they just look terrible.', '2006-08-19 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742292, 379734, 63990, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-08-19 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742299, 380629, 63990, '<td valign="top">Nice Job!!</td>', 'Nice Job!!', '2006-08-19 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742303, 377886, 63990, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2006-08-19 20:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742311, 379243, 33400, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the DOF. But I think the contrast is a little sharp.  Still a god pic.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the DOF. But I think the contrast is a little sharp.  Still a god pic.', '2006-08-19 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742318, 380700, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  You might want to try this with a little fill light on the pea. It''s the subject of the shot and is a little dark.  Hard to do though I know.  Maybe a little post-process dodge?</td>', 'Good idea.  You might want to try this with a little fill light on the pea. It''s the subject of the shot and is a little dark.  Hard to do though I know.  Maybe a little post-process dodge?', '2006-08-19 20:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742321, 380741, 33400, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the layout.  Your color is a bit warm.</td>', 'I like the angle and the layout.  Your color is a bit warm.', '2006-08-19 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742322, 380362, 33400, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I shouldn''t vote on this when I''m hungry...<br/>Really nice shot.</td>', 'Wow.  I shouldn''t vote on this when I''m hungry...Really nice shot.', '2006-08-19 20:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742327, 380728, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good bokeh effect.  I think your DOF is a little too tight, making the edges blurry.  Since there is little detail on the focused surface, it looks like it''s not as sharp as I think it really is.</td>', 'Great idea and good bokeh effect.  I think your DOF is a little too tight, making the edges blurry.  Since there is little detail on the focused surface, it looks like it''s not as sharp as I think it really is.', '2006-08-19 20:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742331, 380005, 33400, '<td valign="top">OK, I was hungry, but this took it away.  Not that I don''t like the shot - It''s a cool idea.  Just the idea of peas turned baby-food... ick.  I really like the two that escaped.  They give the shot a clever point of interest.</td>', 'OK, I was hungry, but this took it away.  Not that I don''t like the shot - It''s a cool idea.  Just the idea of peas turned baby-food... ick.  I really like the two that escaped.  They give the shot a clever point of interest.', '2006-08-19 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742334, 380729, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very well lit. Good DOF. Nice formation.</td>', 'Very well lit. Good DOF. Nice formation.', '2006-08-19 21:01:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2742337, 379766, 33400, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I wonder how it would look strung around a lovely neck in a black  dress - maybe with a pea earring just visible at the top?  Peas as jewelery. Cool.</td>', 'I like this.  I wonder how it would look strung around a lovely neck in a black  dress - maybe with a pea earring just visible at the top?  Peas as jewelery. Cool.', '2006-08-19 21:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742346, 379861, 33400, '<td valign="top">There will be no PEAS ...until there is CHEESE.<br/>How can there be PEAS when CHEESE is denied us?<br/>Every human being deserves to know the pleasure of CHEESE and PEAS UNITED.<br/> <br/>Sorry...<br/>I''m having way too much fun voting in this challenge.<br/>This is a truly well done shot - good lighting, DOF, focal point.  Very nice<br/> <br/>Seriously though, peas floating in a bowl of warmed-up cheese wiz... It''ll put hair on ya.</td>', 'There will be no PEAS ...until there is CHEESE.How can there be PEAS when CHEESE is denied us?Every human being deserves to know the pleasure of CHEESE and PEAS UNITED. Sorry...I''m having way too much fun voting in this challenge.This is a truly well done shot - good lighting, DOF, focal point.  Very nice Seriously though, peas floating in a bowl of warmed-up cheese wiz... It''ll put hair on ya.', '2006-08-19 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742349, 379945, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great shot and excellent colors.  I wonder if maybe the crop should have moved the peas a little more into it.  Not to the center of course, I''d just like to see the rest of that big one on the top right.</td>', 'Great shot and excellent colors.  I wonder if maybe the crop should have moved the peas a little more into it.  Not to the center of course, I''d just like to see the rest of that big one on the top right.', '2006-08-19 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742350, 379803, 33400, '<td valign="top">...And roasted to perfection.  Nice shot.  Ilke your choice of background.</td>', '...And roasted to perfection.  Nice shot.  Ilke your choice of background.', '2006-08-19 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742354, 379680, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good abstract (I hope you were going for abstract.  If not, then I just missed it, sorry)  I like it anyway</td>', 'Good abstract (I hope you were going for abstract.  If not, then I just missed it, sorry)  I like it anyway', '2006-08-19 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742358, 380518, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Like the DOF.  The mark or label on the background glass is a bit distracting.  Still a good shot.<br/>It would not have worked on me as a kid though...</td>', 'Good shot. Like the DOF.  The mark or label on the background glass is a bit distracting.  Still a good shot.It would not have worked on me as a kid though...', '2006-08-19 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742363, 379131, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I think the crop could have made this better - removing the bottom bowl portion so we just focus on the peas and fork.  Still, I like it.</td>', 'Good shot.  I think the crop could have made this better - removing the bottom bowl portion so we just focus on the peas and fork.  Still, I like it.', '2006-08-19 21:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742367, 380756, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautifully abstract.  great focus, lighting, layout.  Congratulations</td>', 'Beautifully abstract.  great focus, lighting, layout.  Congratulations', '2006-08-19 21:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742373, 380478, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think you should have a little light in the front - just enough to soften the contrast. The back lighting is an interesting take and pulls out the color. I like it.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think you should have a little light in the front - just enough to soften the contrast. The back lighting is an interesting take and pulls out the color. I like it.', '2006-08-19 21:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742374, 380755, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  A little soft, but then you may have wanted that feel.  It works here, so never mind - I like it.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  A little soft, but then you may have wanted that feel.  It works here, so never mind - I like it.', '2006-08-19 21:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742378, 378954, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I really like the contrasting greens (peas and grass)  This is a clever take and very well done.</td>', 'Great colors.  I really like the contrasting greens (peas and grass)  This is a clever take and very well done.', '2006-08-19 21:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742383, 380702, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting.  The minimalist feel here is good.</td>', 'Great focus and lighting.  The minimalist feel here is good.', '2006-08-19 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742387, 380629, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I appreciate the attention to detail. Your ice is clean, there are no fingerprints or spots on the glass, etc. I like the softer light and shadow too.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Very well done.  I appreciate the attention to detail. Your ice is clean, there are no fingerprints or spots on the glass, etc. I like the softer light and shadow too.  Congratulations.', '2006-08-19 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742396, 380716, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good set up, and good lighting and contrasts.  This is a very nice picture, but, um... aren''t goober peas actually peanuts?</td>', 'Good set up, and good lighting and contrasts.  This is a very nice picture, but, um... aren''t goober peas actually peanuts?', '2006-08-19 21:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742407, 379336, 33400, '<td valign="top">Excellent "freakout factor"  I didn''t see the eyes first, which worked very well.<br/>I keep staring at them.  I may never open a can of peas again..</td>', 'Excellent "freakout factor"  I didn''t see the eyes first, which worked very well.I keep staring at them.  I may never open a can of peas again..', '2006-08-19 21:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742417, 377886, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is very well done and funny.  A clever idea that you executed incredibly well.  Your title is over-stated  You could have stopped at "Identity Crisis" and we would still get it.<br/>No marks off for title though. The pic stands on it''s own.</td>', 'This is very well done and funny.  A clever idea that you executed incredibly well.  Your title is over-stated  You could have stopped at "Identity Crisis" and we would still get it.No marks off for title though. The pic stands on it''s own.', '2006-08-19 21:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742424, 380395, 33400, '<td valign="top">Sort of a feng shui of peace.  Quite good.</td>', 'Sort of a feng shui of peace.  Quite good.', '2006-08-19 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742430, 379458, 33400, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  Very nice.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  Very nice.', '2006-08-19 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742460, 379332, 33400, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2006-08-19 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742464, 379873, 23511, '<td valign="top">not just funny, but well set up - how''d you get the one pea to agree to getting shot?</td>', 'not just funny, but well set up - how''d you get the one pea to agree to getting shot?', '2006-08-19 21:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742467, 380530, 23511, '<td valign="top">I bet someone buys this.  I wonder if there is a way to avoid the red edge effect on the blue backgrounds.</td>', 'I bet someone buys this.  I wonder if there is a way to avoid the red edge effect on the blue backgrounds.', '2006-08-19 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742470, 377886, 23511, '<td valign="top">creative; a macro, flower, pseudo-insect.</td>', 'creative; a macro, flower, pseudo-insect.', '2006-08-19 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742471, 379576, 23511, '<td valign="top">nice lighting / focus</td>', 'nice lighting / focus', '2006-08-19 22:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742474, 380688, 23511, '<td valign="top">Argh!  Been there... And well done.  I like the white background.</td>', 'Argh!  Been there... And well done.  I like the white background.', '2006-08-19 22:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742477, 378796, 23511, '<td valign="top">moong dal = peas?</td>', 'moong dal = peas?', '2006-08-19 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742479, 380096, 23511, '<td valign="top">nice clean composition</td>', 'nice clean composition', '2006-08-19 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742480, 380005, 23511, '<td valign="top">nice play on words - now we have whirld peas</td>', 'nice play on words - now we have whirld peas', '2006-08-19 22:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742483, 380712, 23511, '<td valign="top">cool, abstract - nice detail</td>', 'cool, abstract - nice detail', '2006-08-19 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742531, 378950, 23511, '<td valign="top">If we were rating the titles this would be right up there.</td>', 'If we were rating the titles this would be right up there.', '2006-08-19 22:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742580, 380227, 40370, '<td valign="top">Coloring of the shells is just a bit red/magnenta, otherwise amusing idea and good focus.</td>', 'Coloring of the shells is just a bit red/magnenta, otherwise amusing idea and good focus.', '2006-08-19 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742582, 380728, 40370, '<td valign="top">An image to take pleasure in.</td>', 'An image to take pleasure in.', '2006-08-19 23:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742591, 378487, 40370, '<td valign="top">Very creative, I would never have been able to pull this wonderful idea off, yet I find time to pass judgement ... ummm, anyway ... the shadows are okay, my only real complaint is the loss of definition of the two pods due to the bright lighting. Really i love this, good luck.</td>', 'Very creative, I would never have been able to pull this wonderful idea off, yet I find time to pass judgement ... ummm, anyway ... the shadows are okay, my only real complaint is the loss of definition of the two pods due to the bright lighting. Really i love this, good luck.', '2006-08-19 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742592, 380493, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to a unique image.</td>', 'Nice approach to a unique image.', '2006-08-19 23:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742603, 380735, 40370, '<td valign="top">The background gratient orange color is wonderful and the goblet choice is interesting, however the peas themselves are a bit dark and are lost in the blown hightlights on the glass.</td>', 'The background gratient orange color is wonderful and the goblet choice is interesting, however the peas themselves are a bit dark and are lost in the blown hightlights on the glass.', '2006-08-19 23:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742609, 380651, 40370, '<td valign="top">Very cool set-up but the red is overwhelming and the peas are left unappealing in their coloring.</td>', 'Very cool set-up but the red is overwhelming and the peas are left unappealing in their coloring.', '2006-08-19 23:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742616, 380664, 40370, '<td valign="top">Holy imagination at work.</td>', 'Holy imagination at work.', '2006-08-19 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742666, 379583, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice dof.</td>', 'nice dof.', '2006-08-19 23:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742667, 380537, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice b&amp;w. i like the tones.</td>', 'nice b&w. i like the tones.', '2006-08-19 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742673, 377886, 41047, '<td valign="top">funny one, i like the dof.</td>', 'funny one, i like the dof.', '2006-08-19 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742738, 379535, 23511, '<td valign="top">nice idea; wonderful how you minimized glare / reflections of extraneous components, etc.  Good color balance</td>', 'nice idea; wonderful how you minimized glare / reflections of extraneous components, etc.  Good color balance', '2006-08-20 00:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2742740, 380736, 23511, '<td valign="top">sweet - I know this person.</td>', 'sweet - I know this person.', '2006-08-20 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
