(2744317, 380748, 33400, '<td valign="top">This would be more provocative if it weren''t a PEA challenge.  Thechnically it''s OK, I think your background could be a bit less noticeable (wrinkles in the back) but it''s good enough.  The point of this shot seems to be the play on words. But it''s just peas... Oh well.  Good luck.</td>', 'This would be more provocative if it weren''t a PEA challenge.  Thechnically it''s OK, I think your background could be a bit less noticeable (wrinkles in the back) but it''s good enough.  The point of this shot seems to be the play on words. But it''s just peas... Oh well.  Good luck.', '2006-08-20 20:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744322, 380595, 33400, '<td valign="top">I applaud everyone who had fun with this subject.  Nice idea.  Your focus is a bit off.  I''m looking for it to be a DOF thing, but I''m not sure.  Still a fun pic though.</td>', 'I applaud everyone who had fun with this subject.  Nice idea.  Your focus is a bit off.  I''m looking for it to be a DOF thing, but I''m not sure.  Still a fun pic though.', '2006-08-20 20:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
