(2744961, 380668, 11923, '<td valign="top">This looks really not tasty at all.  Heh.  Interesting idea.  The lighting looks okay but the focus seems to fall off a bit at the top.  I gave a 5</td>', 'This looks really not tasty at all.  Heh.  Interesting idea.  The lighting looks okay but the focus seems to fall off a bit at the top.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-21 02:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744963, 380275, 11923, '<td valign="top">Yikes that poor peaman looks rather dried out.  Cute shot!  Lighting is a bit harsh but it helps drive home the story your title infers.  Focus looks pretty good and I like the composition.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Yikes that poor peaman looks rather dried out.  Cute shot!  Lighting is a bit harsh but it helps drive home the story your title infers.  Focus looks pretty good and I like the composition.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-21 02:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744968, 380518, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity.  I like the color pop versus the desaturated surroundings.  Composition is nice, I wonder how it would look if that bottle had peas in it though as if they''d been poured out from there.  That kind of looks like why it is in the image but the connection is somewhat tenuous if so.  Interesting idea.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Nice clarity.  I like the color pop versus the desaturated surroundings.  Composition is nice, I wonder how it would look if that bottle had peas in it though as if they''d been poured out from there.  That kind of looks like why it is in the image but the connection is somewhat tenuous if so.  Interesting idea.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-21 02:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744970, 379289, 11923, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird.  Nice lighting on the greens and good clarity too.  I wish the lighting was better on the bird''s head though since it is a major part of the image.   I gave a 5</td>', 'Pretty bird.  Nice lighting on the greens and good clarity too.  I wish the lighting was better on the bird''s head though since it is a major part of the image.   I gave a 5', '2006-08-21 02:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745018, 380735, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I''m not fond of orange but I think in this case I actually like the shade you chose for the background.  The image is interesting though I find my interest less in the subject (the peas) and more in the nice crystal goblet.  Lighting looks good, I wonder if this might draw me in more if the perspective was different.  Higher up or looking straight down at the top.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Nice photo.  I''m not fond of orange but I think in this case I actually like the shade you chose for the background.  The image is interesting though I find my interest less in the subject (the peas) and more in the nice crystal goblet.  Lighting looks good, I wonder if this might draw me in more if the perspective was different.  Higher up or looking straight down at the top.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-21 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745027, 379734, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this image, nice clarity and the color is great.  I like the light and how it makes the pods looks almost translucent.  Very nicely envisioned.  I gave a 6</td>', 'I like this image, nice clarity and the color is great.  I like the light and how it makes the pods looks almost translucent.  Very nicely envisioned.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-21 02:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
