(2754464, 378166, 31409, '<td valign="top">Is this the same photo as the one in the Fire challenge?</td>', 'Is this the same photo as the one in the Fire challenge?', '2006-08-23 21:26:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2754505, 378763, 58590, '<td valign="top">i love this pic... would make a great print... hint hint ;-)</td>', 'i love this pic... would make a great print... hint hint ;-)', '2006-08-23 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2755103, 379131, 54728, '<td valign="top">ha!  it''s cool to know how you did that.  Thanks for explaining!  I like the more natural green color.</td>', 'ha!  it''s cool to know how you did that.  Thanks for explaining!  I like the more natural green color.', '2006-08-24 00:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2756294, 380158, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good idea here, but the execution and technical aspects are lacking. It almost looks like an ad that was clipped and scanned. The colors and lighting seem odd and the focus is off, almost like it was cropped too tight from a much larger picture. And the head pea seems way too small ;). Rough shot overall - but we know you can do way better.</td>', 'I think you have a good idea here, but the execution and technical aspects are lacking. It almost looks like an ad that was clipped and scanned. The colors and lighting seem odd and the focus is off, almost like it was cropped too tight from a much larger picture. And the head pea seems way too small ;). Rough shot overall - but we know you can do way better.', '2006-08-24 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2756369, 379186, 43714, '<td valign="top">This is so adorable, love it!</td>', 'This is so adorable, love it!', '2006-08-24 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2756377, 380753, 43714, '<td valign="top">Very classy, as always. Love it.</td>', 'Very classy, as always. Love it.', '2006-08-24 10:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2756387, 379662, 43714, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot, very well done. Congrats</td>', 'Nice clean shot, very well done. Congrats', '2006-08-24 10:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2756660, 380158, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Really like the idea.. quite cute!  The staging is good but the technicals are weak - looks a bit overexposed and grainy to me and probably could have used a bit more dramatic lighting.  Still, I gotta admire the time and patience it must have taken to put peas on a paperclip.</td>', 'LOL!  Really like the idea.. quite cute!  The staging is good but the technicals are weak - looks a bit overexposed and grainy to me and probably could have used a bit more dramatic lighting.  Still, I gotta admire the time and patience it must have taken to put peas on a paperclip.', '2006-08-24 12:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2757054, 379583, 59215, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh so hard! Very funny idea and nice execution- the blur is nice, very dramatic.</td>', 'This made me laugh so hard! Very funny idea and nice execution- the blur is nice, very dramatic.', '2006-08-24 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2757508, 377322, 19708, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//img116.exs.cx/img116/1231/z7shysterical.gif'', strrpos(''//img116.exs.cx/img116/1231/z7shysterical.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//img116.exs.cx/img116/1231/z7shysterical.gif"/> <br/>Expected this to be in the top 20</td>', ' Expected this to be in the top 20', '2006-08-24 18:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2757692, 380629, 22301, '<td valign="top">congrats on your new personal best, I agree that it should have been ranked higher too, but 6.315 is still great. well done</td>', 'congrats on your new personal best, I agree that it should have been ranked higher too, but 6.315 is still great. well done', '2006-08-24 19:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2757799, 379186, 60686, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL SHOT!!!<br/> <br/>(not to mention that the editing is out of thsi world!)</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL SHOT!!! (not to mention that the editing is out of thsi world!)', '2006-08-24 19:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2757935, 378800, 3724, '<td valign="top">maybe a cookbook kind of picture, has a kitchen quality to it.<br/>darker shadowed foreground severely cut in half on a diagonal to hot lighted background makes a strong graphic statement.  The bright/dark effect seems a bit strong and to an extent overpowers the peas.  Emphasis of the peas themselves appears somewhat weak - due to the dof/sharpen issue others have mentioned.<br/>Presentation is good w/delicate finely crafted beautiful frame.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your new purchase.....  Sigma 10/20mm    I think a wonderful choice for your excellent architectural eye, but also work with it for closeup it will surprise you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-26 11:23:54.</i></td>', 'maybe a cookbook kind of picture, has a kitchen quality to it.darker shadowed foreground severely cut in half on a diagonal to hot lighted background makes a strong graphic statement.  The bright/dark effect seems a bit strong and to an extent overpowers the peas.  Emphasis of the peas themselves appears somewhat weak - due to the dof/sharpen issue others have mentioned.Presentation is good w/delicate finely crafted beautiful frame. Congratulations on your new purchase.....  Sigma 10/20mm    I think a wonderful choice for your excellent architectural eye, but also work with it for closeup it will surprise you.', '2006-08-24 20:33:12.000000', '2006-08-26 12:23:54.000000', 0),
